345
00:29:33.023 --> 00:29:35.192
and apparently he was
part of some secret society.

346
00:29:36.109 --> 00:29:37.109
It was a cult.

347
00:29:37.778 --> 00:29:39.071
They were historians. you know.

348
00:29:39.780 --> 00:29:41.615
And he recorded everything in his notebook.

349
00:29:42.491 --> 00:29:43.825
Look. I was gonna tell you.

350
00:29:44.535 --> 00:29:45.869
No. let me tell you.

351
00:29:45.953 --> 00:29:49.456
- My father was not a good man. Joseph.
- Mom...

352
00:29:49.540 --> 00:29:53.544
When my mom's mind
started to go. he retreated.

353
00:29:54.127 --> 00:29:56.713
Spent more time with
the Circle of the Wise Men than us.

354
00:29:56.797 --> 00:29:58.841
Always off on some expedition.

355
00:29:59.842 --> 00:30:02.135
buried in some stupid old book.

356
00:30:02.219 --> 00:30:05.722
When Aunt Bonnie got sick.
that's when he left us for good.

357
00:30:05.806 --> 00:30:08.976
Hunting for rusty weapons.
Crumbling scrolls.

358
00:30:09.059 --> 00:30:11.353
He said he had to find a way
to protect us from evil.

359
00:30:11.436 --> 00:30:12.796
All he ever did was talk like that

360
00:30:12.855 --> 00:30:15.816
