412
00:34:32.739 --> 00:34:34.366
A Greek queen.

413
00:34:34.449 --> 00:34:36.534
- She's Edgar's favorite.
- It's pretty.

414
00:34:37.244 --> 00:34:38.286
Yeah.

415
